1
00:00:00,208 --> 00:00:02,458
Dear Uncle, exactly like Napoleon Bonaparte,

2
00:00:02,458 --> 00:00:03,750
Had one big flaw.

3
00:00:03,958 --> 00:00:05,583
Victory made him so arrogant

4
00:00:05,625 --> 00:00:07,208
That he underestimated the enemy.

5
00:00:07,958 --> 00:00:09,208
On the night of the mourning ceremony,

6
00:00:09,208 --> 00:00:11,708
And then in the pharmacy boycott,

7
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:13,958
He had badly defeated Agha Jan!

8
00:00:14,083 --> 00:00:14,375
But

9
00:00:14,708 --> 00:00:17,583
Dustali-Khan's affair with Tahereh, the wife of Shir-Ali the butcher,

10
00:00:18,083 --> 00:00:20,333
Shook his magnificent position,

11
00:00:20,708 --> 00:00:22,500
And handed the advantage to Agha Jan.

12
00:00:22,958 --> 00:00:23,583
Now

13
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:26,208
The family's centuries-old reputation

14
00:00:26,458 --> 00:00:27,583
Was in danger.

15
00:00:29,333 --> 00:00:32,125
Fearing revenge from Shir-Ali the butcher, Dustali-Khan

16
00:00:32,125 --> 00:00:34,208
Was still hiding in an unknown place,

17
00:00:34,333 --> 00:00:36,000
And his wife, Lady Aziz-Saltaneh,

18
00:00:36,208 --> 00:00:38,708
Had fallen in love with Prince Asdollah-Mirza,

19
00:00:38,875 --> 00:00:39,833
And the Prince, who

20
00:00:39,833 --> 00:00:41,875
Had confessed to murdering Dustali-Khan,

21
00:00:41,958 --> 00:00:44,208
Was still caught in Nayeb Teymoor-Khan's clutches,

22
00:00:44,208 --> 00:00:45,458
The police inspector,

23
00:00:45,458 --> 00:00:46,375
With no way out.

24
00:00:47,083 --> 00:00:48,333
The Prince's life

25
00:00:48,375 --> 00:00:50,000
Was threatened by two dangers.

26
00:00:50,708 --> 00:00:52,125
First, the noose,

27
00:00:52,625 --> 00:00:53,333
Second,

28
00:00:53,583 --> 00:00:56,083
The magnificent love of Lady Aziz-Saltaneh!

29
00:00:56,083 --> 00:02:53,383
(Sound of horses galloping)

30
00:02:56,133 --> 00:02:59,008
Dear Uncle Napoleon Episode 5

31
00:02:59,925 --> 00:03:02,383
Based on the novel Dear Uncle Napoleon, written by Iraj Pezeshkzad

32
00:03:02,383 --> 00:03:05,091
Subtitles: Iman Soleimani Zadeh

33
00:03:13,508 --> 00:03:15,508
♪ Traditional music ♪

34
00:03:35,716 --> 00:03:37,425
Who do you want to telephone?

35
00:03:37,425 --> 00:03:38,925
To the police chief!

36
00:03:38,925 --> 00:03:40,091
To come here and do what?

37
00:03:40,175 --> 00:03:42,966
These inspectors are tormenting a poor young man!

38
00:03:43,216 --> 00:03:45,050
No matter how often I tell that idiot Nayeb

39
00:03:45,050 --> 00:03:47,175
That this poor wretch is an innocent child,

40
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:47,925
He doesn’t listen!

41
00:03:48,175 --> 00:03:50,300
Now I want to call his boss and tell him

42
00:03:50,300 --> 00:03:52,216
That poor Asdollah is innocent!

43
00:03:52,550 --> 00:03:53,675
Lady, don’t make a scene!

44
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,925
I want to tell him

45
00:03:55,175 --> 00:03:57,050
That one of you killed Dustali!

46
00:03:57,175 --> 00:03:58,425
I want to say that,

47
00:03:58,425 --> 00:04:00,966
Poor Asdollah isn't to blame at all!

48
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:03,550
A poor young man is rotting in prison!

49
00:04:03,675 --> 00:04:04,175
What happened, Saeid?

50
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:06,091
Lady Aziz and Dear Uncle are fighting! Lady Aziz-Saltaneh!-

51
00:04:06,216 --> 00:04:07,300
Go see what's going on! Don’t scream so much!-

52
00:04:07,300 --> 00:04:08,675
Don’t shout!

53
00:04:08,716 --> 00:04:09,841
I'll scream!

54
00:04:09,925 --> 00:04:11,050
I'll shout!

55
00:04:11,175 --> 00:04:12,550
I'll yell!

56
00:04:12,675 --> 00:04:14,425
I'll go and expose all of you!

57
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,925
It was you who made Dustali disappear!

58
00:04:16,966 --> 00:04:17,800
I want to say,

59
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:18,675
Poor Asdollah,

60
00:04:18,675 --> 00:04:20,550
Is sacrificing himself for you!

61
00:04:21,216 --> 00:04:22,175
Strange!

62
00:04:22,175 --> 00:04:23,800
She just keeps shouting!

63
00:04:24,925 --> 00:04:26,675
Who told you to come here?

64
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:27,716
Go to the women's quarters!

65
00:04:27,716 --> 00:04:29,216
You think I don’t know?

66
00:04:29,341 --> 00:04:31,050
Either you made Dustali disappear

67
00:04:31,050 --> 00:04:33,050
And blamed that innocent child, Asdollah!

68
00:04:33,050 --> 00:04:34,216
Or you hid him somewhere

69
00:04:34,300 --> 00:04:36,841
To palm off that old-maid Farrokh Lagha of yours on him!

70
00:04:36,925 --> 00:04:38,550
You think I don't know what's going on?

71
00:04:39,925 --> 00:04:41,550
My dear Lady Aziz!

72
00:04:41,675 --> 00:04:43,175
Please!

73
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:44,341
I don’t know,

74
00:04:44,425 --> 00:04:46,425
What vile person

75
00:04:46,425 --> 00:04:48,591
Put this idea in your head!

76
00:04:49,050 --> 00:04:50,300
Please!

77
00:04:50,425 --> 00:04:52,050
Don’t shout.

78
00:04:52,216 --> 00:04:53,550
I'll scream!

79
00:04:53,550 --> 00:04:54,675
I'll shout!

80
00:04:54,675 --> 00:04:56,966
If only you were a tiny bit like Asdollah!

81
00:04:57,966 --> 00:04:58,550
What a pity...

82
00:04:58,550 --> 00:05:01,091
What a pity that Asdollah is related to you.

83
00:05:01,175 --> 00:05:02,841
A man so noble…

84
00:05:02,925 --> 00:05:04,050
So delicate…

85
00:05:04,550 --> 00:05:05,966
So sensitive…

86
00:05:06,550 --> 00:05:08,216
Could he kill anyone?

87
00:05:08,716 --> 00:05:11,675
Nobody killed Dustali at all!

88
00:05:11,716 --> 00:05:14,425
He ran off, afraid of you

89
00:05:14,466 --> 00:05:17,466
He's scared of you, so he hid!

90
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,425
So now I'm scary?

91
00:05:19,675 --> 00:05:20,966
Dustali hid because he fears me?

92
00:05:21,050 --> 00:05:22,300
Do you know what you're saying, old man?

93
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:24,425
What a pity that Asdollah is related to you!

94
00:05:25,425 --> 00:05:26,216
Lady!

95
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:29,425
Right now I don’t know where Dustali is!

96
00:05:29,425 --> 00:05:31,550
But I give you my word of honor

97
00:05:31,550 --> 00:05:33,800
That he hasn't gone far!

98
00:05:33,925 --> 00:05:35,716
He's hiding somewhere!

99
00:05:35,925 --> 00:05:38,550
Rest assured, wherever he's gone,

100
00:05:38,591 --> 00:05:40,591
By tomorrow, safe and sound,

101
00:05:40,675 --> 00:05:42,091
I'll deliver him to you!

102
00:05:42,716 --> 00:05:44,966
Dustali loves you!

103
00:05:45,175 --> 00:05:47,175
How could he just leave!

104
00:05:47,175 --> 00:05:48,300
To hell with Dustali!

105
00:05:48,300 --> 00:05:49,925
I must telephone!

106
00:05:50,091 --> 00:05:51,216
Lady Aziz!

107
00:05:51,300 --> 00:05:53,175
Calling the police chief

108
00:05:53,175 --> 00:05:55,091
Is no use!

109
00:05:55,425 --> 00:05:56,466
Allow me

110
00:05:56,466 --> 00:05:58,841
To send for Nayeb Teymoor-Khan

111
00:05:58,925 --> 00:05:59,675
To come here.

112
00:05:59,716 --> 00:06:02,091
Everything is in his hands!

113
00:06:02,466 --> 00:06:03,800
When he comes,

114
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,341
You tell him

115
00:06:05,425 --> 00:06:07,175
Dustali has been found.

116
00:06:07,175 --> 00:06:09,675
Meaning you know where he went.

117
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,716
If you say that,

118
00:06:11,966 --> 00:06:14,425
Asdollah will be freed sooner,

119
00:06:14,425 --> 00:06:16,550
And we'll have more time

120
00:06:16,550 --> 00:06:19,425
To search and find that idiot Dustali.

121
00:06:19,550 --> 00:06:21,300
If you drag your feet,

122
00:06:21,300 --> 00:06:25,966
They'll take poor Asdollah to prison!

123
00:06:28,591 --> 00:06:29,800
I'd rather die

124
00:06:29,841 --> 00:06:32,050
Than see that young man in prison!

125
00:06:39,675 --> 00:06:40,425
Okay.

126
00:06:41,175 --> 00:06:42,425
I have no objection.

127
00:06:43,050 --> 00:06:44,966
Only for Asdollah.

128
00:06:49,300 --> 00:06:50,925
Very well, tell the Nayeb to come.

129
00:06:51,300 --> 00:06:53,091
I'll withdraw my complaint altogether.

130
00:06:53,550 --> 00:06:54,550
No, lady!

131
00:06:54,550 --> 00:06:56,925
That's no use!

132
00:06:57,050 --> 00:06:59,675
You must tell him

133
00:07:00,300 --> 00:07:03,300
That Dustali isn't dead!

134
00:07:03,300 --> 00:07:04,550
He's alive!

135
00:07:04,841 --> 00:07:07,050
That he talked to you,

136
00:07:07,091 --> 00:07:09,675
I mean, he called you on the phone!

137
00:07:09,675 --> 00:07:10,925
I promise

138
00:07:10,925 --> 00:07:12,591
That by tomorrow Dustali…

139
00:07:12,675 --> 00:07:15,550
Dustali's bald head isn't worth one hair of Asdollah's!

140
00:07:15,841 --> 00:07:18,300
For all I care, he can lose his head!

141
00:07:18,300 --> 00:07:19,925
If I don't want to live with Dustali,

142
00:07:19,925 --> 00:07:20,800
Whose business is it? Huh?

143
00:07:23,550 --> 00:07:24,550
Ghasem!

144
00:07:27,175 --> 00:07:28,175
Oh, good Lord…

145
00:07:28,175 --> 00:07:29,175
If Sir sees you,

146
00:07:29,175 --> 00:07:30,550
He'll tear you to pieces!

147
00:07:30,550 --> 00:07:31,591
Run, my boy! Go!

148
00:07:37,966 --> 00:07:38,675
Ghasem!

149
00:07:39,091 --> 00:07:41,091
Where were you, man!

150
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:42,716
God bless you!

151
00:07:43,091 --> 00:07:46,050
Quick, go over to Shamsali-Mirza's house,

152
00:07:46,050 --> 00:07:47,966
Tell him Lady Aziz says

153
00:07:48,050 --> 00:07:49,300
Dustali has been found.

154
00:07:49,300 --> 00:07:51,091
Come here for a minute, quick!

155
00:07:51,091 --> 00:07:51,841
Congratulations!

156
00:07:51,841 --> 00:07:54,050
Lady, don't forget my reward for the good news!

157
00:07:54,175 --> 00:07:55,425
Wait, my dear!

158
00:07:55,841 --> 00:07:58,091
Wait until Dustali turns up here,

159
00:07:58,175 --> 00:07:59,716
Then, as your reward,

160
00:07:59,716 --> 00:08:01,675
I'll break a club over your head and that idiot's!

161
00:08:02,175 --> 00:08:03,466
Thank you, lady!

162
00:08:03,466 --> 00:08:04,841
You want a reward, huh?

163
00:08:08,966 --> 00:08:09,550
Sir!

164
00:08:09,550 --> 00:08:11,425
You can kiss the pharmacy goodbye.

165
00:08:12,466 --> 00:08:14,091
You said to close for one day,

166
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:15,216
So we closed.

167
00:08:16,300 --> 00:08:18,216
But it still did no good!

168
00:08:18,466 --> 00:08:20,591
People have more faith in healers and prayers

169
00:08:20,591 --> 00:08:22,175
Than in medicine and doctors!

170
00:08:22,300 --> 00:08:23,300
We need another idea.

171
00:08:23,300 --> 00:08:24,966
Didn't you write what I told you about

172
00:08:24,966 --> 00:08:26,841
The change in the pharmacy's decor

173
00:08:26,925 --> 00:08:28,925
On the door?

174
00:08:29,050 --> 00:08:29,800
Yes!

175
00:08:30,466 --> 00:08:30,966
I did,

176
00:08:31,050 --> 00:08:32,841
Written large, in fine handwriting!

177
00:08:33,341 --> 00:08:35,425
I also had it written on a big banner!

178
00:08:35,425 --> 00:08:37,425
In the hand of Mirza Ali the calligrapher!

179
00:08:37,925 --> 00:08:40,050
But it seems nobody paid attention to the signs.

180
00:08:40,550 --> 00:08:41,050
Agha Joon!

181
00:08:41,216 --> 00:08:43,591
Once something gets into these people's heads,

182
00:08:43,591 --> 00:08:45,050
It's hard to get it out.

183
00:08:45,091 --> 00:08:46,050
What do you mean!

184
00:08:46,300 --> 00:08:47,550
What are people saying?

185
00:08:47,591 --> 00:08:48,550
What grudge do they have?

186
00:08:49,716 --> 00:08:50,550
Nothing, Sir!

187
00:08:50,925 --> 00:08:51,716
They say nothing.

188
00:08:52,550 --> 00:08:53,925
Today not a single person came

189
00:08:53,925 --> 00:08:56,175
To buy a pinch of sodium sulfate from us!

190
00:08:56,925 --> 00:08:58,341
This morning, some poor soul,

191
00:08:58,591 --> 00:09:01,841
A villager passing by, tried to step into the pharmacy,

192
00:09:02,425 --> 00:09:04,591
The greengrocer and the grocer

193
00:09:04,591 --> 00:09:07,300
Heaped so many curses on the poor man

194
00:09:07,716 --> 00:09:08,925
That he got scared and left!

195
00:09:11,966 --> 00:09:13,925
We must find a way.

196
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:15,925
What do you say?

197
00:09:16,550 --> 00:09:18,841
Now you think of a solution.

198
00:09:19,550 --> 00:09:20,675
There's no way, Sir!

199
00:09:21,425 --> 00:09:23,216
I know the locals well.

200
00:09:24,175 --> 00:09:26,341
They've got it into their heads that we

201
00:09:26,341 --> 00:09:28,800
Make our medicines with alcohol and liquor!

202
00:09:29,841 --> 00:09:31,550
Even at death's door,

203
00:09:32,216 --> 00:09:33,925
They'd never buy medicine from us!

204
00:09:34,050 --> 00:09:34,591
Impossible!

205
00:09:34,591 --> 00:09:37,466
(He chokes on his food and coughs)

206
00:09:37,466 --> 00:09:39,050
That brother-in-law of yours

207
00:09:39,466 --> 00:09:40,800
Spread a rumor that I

208
00:09:41,675 --> 00:09:43,091
Have no religion or faith!

209
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:45,800
So I've closed the pharmacy for now,

210
00:09:45,925 --> 00:09:47,300
Until I see what you say!

211
00:09:47,675 --> 00:09:48,091
Nothing!

212
00:09:48,841 --> 00:09:50,466
For now, switch off the electricity,

213
00:09:50,550 --> 00:09:51,841
Keep the pharmacy closed too,

214
00:09:52,175 --> 00:09:54,175
Until I make this bastard pay!

215
00:09:54,591 --> 00:09:55,800
This scoundrel wants

216
00:09:55,800 --> 00:09:57,050
To ruin my life!

217
00:09:57,591 --> 00:09:58,675
I'll make him suffer so badly

218
00:09:58,716 --> 00:09:59,800
It'll go down in history!

219
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:01,925
I'll bring the same disaster on him

220
00:10:01,925 --> 00:10:03,550
That the English brought on Napoleon!

221
00:10:04,050 --> 00:10:06,800
I'm no man if I don't put him in his grave!

222
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:08,675
Oh, you scoundrel!

223
00:10:09,550 --> 00:10:11,425
You vile wretch!

224
00:10:12,550 --> 00:10:14,966
I'll plant such a Napoleon in his grave

225
00:10:16,050 --> 00:10:18,425
That seven Napoleons will sprout beside him!

226
00:10:18,675 --> 00:10:22,841
I'm very glad the misunderstanding has been cleared up.

227
00:10:23,216 --> 00:10:26,425
Thank God, the lady's husband is safe and sound

228
00:10:26,550 --> 00:10:29,341
At the house of one of the relatives!

229
00:10:29,341 --> 00:10:29,800
Quiet!

230
00:10:30,675 --> 00:10:32,716
Are you sure the victim is alive?

231
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:34,716
Yes, yes, Mr. Nayeb!

232
00:10:36,050 --> 00:10:37,091
Mr. Nayeb!

233
00:10:37,466 --> 00:10:40,091
Fortunately it turned out that Dustali is alive.

234
00:10:40,591 --> 00:10:42,675
Bad weeds never die!

235
00:10:43,341 --> 00:10:45,300
This jackass won't die

236
00:10:45,300 --> 00:10:46,466
Until he's finished me off!

237
00:10:46,466 --> 00:10:47,716
Thank God a hundred thousand times

238
00:10:47,716 --> 00:10:49,966
That husband and wife are finally together again.

239
00:10:50,175 --> 00:10:50,591
Praise God!

240
00:10:51,675 --> 00:10:52,425
Hold on!

241
00:10:52,925 --> 00:10:55,175
If the victim is alive,

242
00:10:55,466 --> 00:10:58,550
Then why did you confess to his murder? Well?

243
00:10:58,675 --> 00:10:59,425
Answer!

244
00:10:59,425 --> 00:11:00,425
Quick, fast, swift!

245
00:11:01,175 --> 00:11:02,091
I…

246
00:11:02,175 --> 00:11:03,300
I think…

247
00:11:03,300 --> 00:11:04,466
I dreamed that…

248
00:11:04,466 --> 00:11:05,300
Quiet!

249
00:11:05,300 --> 00:11:06,300
Are you mocking me?

250
00:11:06,716 --> 00:11:08,050
A man gets killed!

251
00:11:08,300 --> 00:11:08,966
The killer,

252
00:11:09,091 --> 00:11:11,591
With smooth talk, steals the victim's wife's heart…

253
00:11:11,716 --> 00:11:14,550
Then the victim's wife declares that her husband is alive!

254
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:17,175
And the investigating officer,

255
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:18,925
Like a good child,

256
00:11:18,925 --> 00:11:20,550
Says good night to them!

257
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:25,050
God willing, I'll put the noose around your neck myself!

258
00:11:25,300 --> 00:11:25,716
What?

259
00:11:26,175 --> 00:11:27,216
Noose?

260
00:11:27,966 --> 00:11:29,800
I'll put the noose around your father's neck!

261
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:32,175
I'll gouge your eyes out! Lady Aziz-Saltaneh!-

262
00:11:32,175 --> 00:11:33,050
Lady!

263
00:11:33,091 --> 00:11:34,550
Please!

264
00:11:34,966 --> 00:11:36,091
I beg you!

265
00:11:36,341 --> 00:11:37,925
Mr. Nayeb is

266
00:11:37,925 --> 00:11:40,800
Doing his legal duty!

267
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:42,925
You must explain to him,

268
00:11:42,925 --> 00:11:43,675
Not that…

269
00:11:43,675 --> 00:11:44,716
What business is it of yours?

270
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:45,966
Why are you interfering?

271
00:11:46,050 --> 00:11:47,341
What's your business in this neighborhood?

272
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:50,175
My jackass of a husband went off carousing!

273
00:11:50,175 --> 00:11:51,300
And you bring an inspector!

274
00:11:51,300 --> 00:11:52,466
This inspector has no sense!

275
00:11:52,466 --> 00:11:52,800
Quiet!-

276
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:54,591
He's accusing an innocent young man!

277
00:11:54,675 --> 00:11:55,800
What business is it of yours?

278
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:58,050
I said quiet!

279
00:11:58,050 --> 00:11:59,800
Damn you and your "quiet"!

280
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:02,425
I'll hit him on the head with this dustpan so hard

281
00:12:02,425 --> 00:12:04,425
That his glasses go into those blind eyes!

282
00:12:04,466 --> 00:12:06,091
Lady Aziz! For heaven's sake, calm down!

283
00:12:06,175 --> 00:12:07,800
Please!

284
00:12:08,091 --> 00:12:09,925
Whatever you say, Asdollah!

285
00:12:16,300 --> 00:12:18,841
Until I see the victim with my own eyes,

286
00:12:18,966 --> 00:12:20,841
I can't release the accused.

287
00:12:21,175 --> 00:12:22,550
Aspiran Ghias Abadi!

288
00:12:24,675 --> 00:12:25,466
Yes, Sir!

289
00:12:25,550 --> 00:12:26,800
Arrest the accused.

290
00:12:31,800 --> 00:12:33,591
Wait a minute!

291
00:12:34,216 --> 00:12:37,591
(Crowd shouting)

292
00:12:37,925 --> 00:12:39,175
What is going on here?

293
00:12:39,550 --> 00:12:41,425
Assaulting a government officer

294
00:12:41,425 --> 00:12:42,675
While on duty!

295
00:12:42,800 --> 00:12:44,175
You are under arrest too, lady!

296
00:12:44,300 --> 00:12:44,966
Aspiran!

297
00:12:45,050 --> 00:12:46,175
Arrest the lady.

298
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:47,300
Sir!

299
00:12:47,341 --> 00:12:49,050
Sir, you…

300
00:12:49,050 --> 00:12:50,175
Please arrest the lady yourself.

301
00:12:50,550 --> 00:12:51,675
I'll bring the killer!

302
00:12:51,800 --> 00:12:53,425
Stop, why are you running?

303
00:12:53,466 --> 00:12:54,966
Stop, if you dare!

304
00:12:55,050 --> 00:12:56,425
Stop! I'm out of breath!-

305
00:12:56,425 --> 00:12:57,466
Go arrest him!

306
00:12:57,550 --> 00:12:58,591
What is this nonsense?-

307
00:12:59,216 --> 00:13:00,425
Stop, will you!

308
00:13:00,550 --> 00:13:02,716
Stop and I'll show you how an arrest is done!

309
00:13:03,550 --> 00:13:05,675
Asdollah, do something!

310
00:13:05,675 --> 00:13:07,300
Moment! Moment!

311
00:13:07,341 --> 00:13:09,675
So now we're wild animal tamers? I'll tear you to pieces!-

312
00:13:09,675 --> 00:13:10,466
Dear Lady Aziz!

313
00:13:10,466 --> 00:13:11,841
Aziz dear!

314
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:13,675
Out of the way!

315
00:13:13,800 --> 00:13:16,341
Aziz… put this dustpan down!

316
00:13:16,341 --> 00:13:17,216
Please!

317
00:13:17,300 --> 00:13:20,050
Aziz, let us explain the matter to Mr. Nayeb.

318
00:13:20,091 --> 00:13:22,175
Fighting and quarreling gets us nowhere,

319
00:13:22,175 --> 00:13:24,175
Bless that lovely face of yours, my dear Aziz…

320
00:13:25,175 --> 00:13:26,425
Whatever you say, Asdollah!

321
00:13:26,425 --> 00:13:27,300
You're a dear.

322
00:13:27,341 --> 00:13:27,966
Sir!

323
00:13:28,300 --> 00:13:29,841
Mr. Asdollah-Mirza?

324
00:13:30,050 --> 00:13:31,425
Let's go, shall we?

325
00:13:31,466 --> 00:13:33,425
You are a sensible killer!

326
00:13:33,716 --> 00:13:34,300
Out of the way!

327
00:13:34,675 --> 00:13:35,800
The lady will get angry again!

328
00:13:41,925 --> 00:13:42,675
Mr. Nayeb,

329
00:13:42,716 --> 00:13:44,300
You see that

330
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:46,050
Dustali-Khan has been found and…

331
00:13:46,050 --> 00:13:48,716
Has told the lady by phone that he's fine.

332
00:13:49,175 --> 00:13:53,425
So the complaint, the investigation and all that are void.

333
00:13:53,425 --> 00:13:54,091
Quiet!

334
00:13:57,966 --> 00:14:00,466
Quiet! You're a judicial investigator,

335
00:14:00,716 --> 00:14:04,550
You claim to know the law,

336
00:14:04,841 --> 00:14:06,341
You explain to him

337
00:14:06,425 --> 00:14:09,300
That a prosecution started by a private complaint,

338
00:14:09,675 --> 00:14:12,091
When murder is involved,

339
00:14:12,175 --> 00:14:14,800
Isn't dropped just because the complainant forgives!

340
00:14:15,716 --> 00:14:17,300
I'm arresting the killer.

341
00:14:17,300 --> 00:14:19,216
You, come to the office tomorrow with the victim

342
00:14:19,300 --> 00:14:21,800
To arrange his release!

343
00:14:21,925 --> 00:14:23,466
Mo... Mo... Mo... Moment! Moment!

344
00:14:23,550 --> 00:14:24,550
Mr. Nayeb!

345
00:14:24,550 --> 00:14:26,050
What if we come and the victim won't come with us?

346
00:14:26,050 --> 00:14:27,091
Then what am I supposed to do?

347
00:14:27,300 --> 00:14:28,300
Do I have to go back to prison?

348
00:14:28,300 --> 00:14:28,716
Quiet!

349
00:14:29,050 --> 00:14:30,175
March to prison!

350
00:14:30,425 --> 00:14:31,300
Quick, fast, swift!

351
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:33,341
You two, march to Imamzadeh Abdollah cemetery!

352
00:14:34,675 --> 00:14:36,716
Let’s go, I'll make a call to their boss

353
00:14:36,716 --> 00:14:38,550
And sort them out!

354
00:14:39,091 --> 00:14:40,091
Lady!

355
00:14:40,175 --> 00:14:41,675
Lady Aziz!

356
00:14:52,925 --> 00:14:54,591
Hello, Chief.

357
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:56,175
You're too kind.

358
00:14:56,841 --> 00:14:57,550
Yes!

359
00:14:57,550 --> 00:14:58,425
He's been found!

360
00:14:58,466 --> 00:15:01,050
He went off in a sulk to a relative's house.

361
00:15:01,550 --> 00:15:03,175
Thank you very, very much!

362
00:15:04,925 --> 00:15:06,425
But, Chief!

363
00:15:06,841 --> 00:15:09,091
This Nayeb Teymoor-Khan of yours says

364
00:15:09,175 --> 00:15:10,800
Dustali has surely been killed!

365
00:15:11,550 --> 00:15:13,716
He wants to arrest Asdollah-Mirza!

366
00:15:14,550 --> 00:15:14,966
Yes?

367
00:15:15,800 --> 00:15:16,925
Yes! That's right!

368
00:15:18,425 --> 00:15:20,800
We keep telling him Asdollah-Mirza isn't the killer,

369
00:15:20,841 --> 00:15:21,800
That Dustali isn't dead,

370
00:15:21,841 --> 00:15:22,800
He won't believe it!

371
00:15:22,925 --> 00:15:23,550
Yes!

372
00:15:23,925 --> 00:15:25,800
Grandson of Roknoddin-Mirza's uncle!

373
00:15:26,425 --> 00:15:27,216
Yes!

374
00:15:28,175 --> 00:15:28,925
Oh?

375
00:15:29,050 --> 00:15:31,050
Yes, yes! The one who was with us!

376
00:15:32,050 --> 00:15:34,550
That year you came to Damavand too!

377
00:15:35,050 --> 00:15:36,425
In Ekhtiaroddoleh's garden.

378
00:15:37,425 --> 00:15:39,300
Remember how much fun it was?

379
00:15:41,716 --> 00:15:43,591
You don’t know what an angel he is!

380
00:15:43,675 --> 00:15:45,300
So decent and kind!

381
00:15:46,841 --> 00:15:47,425
Yes?

382
00:15:47,675 --> 00:15:48,425
Yes, sir!

383
00:15:48,675 --> 00:15:49,425
Right now!

384
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:51,925
He wants to talk to you.

385
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:54,716
Say the wrong thing and I'll skin you! Come!

386
00:15:56,675 --> 00:15:58,300
Sir, with your permission, my respects.

387
00:15:59,175 --> 00:15:59,925
Yes, Sir!

388
00:16:02,300 --> 00:16:03,800
As you command!

389
00:16:04,175 --> 00:16:05,675
But Sir, please note,

390
00:16:05,675 --> 00:16:07,425
In the file we opened,

391
00:16:07,466 --> 00:16:08,050
The lady's complaint

392
00:16:08,091 --> 00:16:09,716
As the murder of her late husband

393
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:11,175
Was written in the file.

394
00:16:11,425 --> 00:16:12,841
Now I personally,

395
00:16:12,925 --> 00:16:14,800
Until I see the accused myself

396
00:16:14,841 --> 00:16:16,591
And verify his identity…

397
00:16:17,425 --> 00:16:18,050
Yes, Sir!

398
00:16:18,550 --> 00:16:19,591
As you command!

399
00:16:20,925 --> 00:16:21,800
What did you say?

400
00:16:22,175 --> 00:16:23,300
The lady herself, Sir?

401
00:16:24,300 --> 00:16:26,425
How can the lady herself vouch for the accused…

402
00:16:26,466 --> 00:16:27,300
Give it to me!

403
00:16:28,675 --> 00:16:29,216
Shut up!

404
00:16:31,925 --> 00:16:32,716
Hello?

405
00:16:33,716 --> 00:16:35,216
Yes, Chief!

406
00:16:35,300 --> 00:16:37,050
I'll vouch for him myself!

407
00:16:37,675 --> 00:16:40,550
No, man! No need for that between us!

408
00:16:40,925 --> 00:16:43,675
In fact, I'll take Asdollah-Mirza to our house tonight

409
00:16:43,675 --> 00:16:44,050
Moment!

410
00:16:44,466 --> 00:16:45,425
Moment!

411
00:16:45,800 --> 00:16:48,341
Your officer can sleep at our house tonight too!

412
00:16:49,841 --> 00:16:51,550
You're taking Asdollah-Mirza to your own house…

413
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:53,675
Let me hear what they're saying, Asdollah!

414
00:16:53,716 --> 00:16:54,175
Me, come to your house…

415
00:16:54,216 --> 00:16:54,800
Yes?

416
00:16:56,425 --> 00:16:57,341
You…

417
00:16:57,425 --> 00:16:58,716
Our upstairs rooms are empty,

418
00:16:58,716 --> 00:16:59,800
You can sleep there.

419
00:16:59,925 --> 00:17:00,550
But… I…

420
00:17:00,591 --> 00:17:00,925
Yes?

421
00:17:01,300 --> 00:17:02,050
Yes, sir!

422
00:17:02,966 --> 00:17:03,800
Mr. Nayeb?

423
00:17:03,966 --> 00:17:04,800
He wants you!

424
00:17:06,425 --> 00:17:07,175
Yes, Sir?

425
00:17:07,175 --> 00:17:08,050
Yes, sir! Me, come to your house?!-

426
00:17:08,925 --> 00:17:09,341
Understood!

427
00:17:09,425 --> 00:17:11,550
Over my dead body will they take you to prison!

428
00:17:13,175 --> 00:17:13,800
Right!

429
00:17:14,050 --> 00:17:15,425
As you command!

430
00:17:15,550 --> 00:17:16,341
It will be done!

431
00:17:16,425 --> 00:17:17,675
But it should be done in a way

432
00:17:17,675 --> 00:17:20,425
That no rules are broken, Sir.

433
00:17:20,550 --> 00:17:21,550
Understood, Sir!

434
00:17:21,800 --> 00:17:23,050
Long may you live, Sir!

435
00:17:23,466 --> 00:17:23,925
With your permission.

436
00:17:30,425 --> 00:17:32,466
The file will be closed forever.

437
00:17:56,050 --> 00:17:58,675
Tonight I'm releasing you on the lady's guarantee.

438
00:17:59,050 --> 00:18:01,175
Aspiran Ghias Abadi will stay at the lady's house too.

439
00:18:01,300 --> 00:18:02,925
You're not allowed to set foot outside the house!

440
00:18:02,966 --> 00:18:03,550
Mr. Nayeb!

441
00:18:03,591 --> 00:18:03,841
Quiet!

442
00:18:07,800 --> 00:18:08,800
Aspiran Ghias Abadi!

443
00:18:08,841 --> 00:18:09,550
Yes, Sir!

444
00:18:09,675 --> 00:18:11,175
You'll stay at the lady's house tonight.

445
00:18:11,675 --> 00:18:13,591
The accused is not allowed to set foot outside the house!

446
00:18:13,800 --> 00:18:14,841
You're responsible, mind you!

447
00:18:14,925 --> 00:18:15,425
Yes, Sir!

448
00:18:15,466 --> 00:18:17,300
Moment! Moment!

449
00:18:17,550 --> 00:18:18,925
If by chance this jackass Dustali

450
00:18:18,925 --> 00:18:20,050
Comes home, what happens?

451
00:18:21,216 --> 00:18:22,800
And what will people say?

452
00:18:24,175 --> 00:18:25,466
Let me sleep right here.

453
00:18:25,550 --> 00:18:26,925
Mr. Aspiran can keep watch too!

454
00:18:27,050 --> 00:18:27,550
Quiet!

455
00:18:27,591 --> 00:18:28,675
That's not fair!

456
00:18:28,716 --> 00:18:29,550
I said quiet!

457
00:18:29,591 --> 00:18:30,716
No more back talk!

458
00:18:32,050 --> 00:18:32,675
The killer

459
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:35,675
Avoids prison only on the lady's legal guarantee.

460
00:18:35,841 --> 00:18:37,925
The lady is your legal guarantor.

461
00:18:37,925 --> 00:18:39,425
Gentlemen!

462
00:18:39,425 --> 00:18:41,341
It’s disgraceful!

463
00:18:41,675 --> 00:18:43,675
A strapping man,

464
00:18:43,716 --> 00:18:44,800
How can he spend the night

465
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:48,841
In the house of a respectable lady whose husband isn't home,

466
00:18:48,841 --> 00:18:49,800
Until morning?

467
00:18:50,341 --> 00:18:54,091
You're throwing the family's honor to the wind!

468
00:18:54,175 --> 00:18:57,050
Shamsali, stop making such a fuss!

469
00:18:57,050 --> 00:18:59,675
Let things calm down!

470
00:18:59,716 --> 00:19:01,925
Asdollah isn't a mouse

471
00:19:01,966 --> 00:19:03,216
For a cat to eat him!

472
00:19:03,300 --> 00:19:05,216
What are you saying, Sir!

473
00:19:05,216 --> 00:19:08,425
Asdollah can sleep at his own house tonight,

474
00:19:08,466 --> 00:19:09,966
Or stay here.

475
00:19:10,425 --> 00:19:12,550
Which regulation does this break?

476
00:19:12,550 --> 00:19:12,925
Quiet!

477
00:19:13,341 --> 00:19:14,716
Who gave you permission

478
00:19:14,716 --> 00:19:16,675
To interfere with the law's representative?

479
00:19:16,675 --> 00:19:17,175
Answer!

480
00:19:17,175 --> 00:19:17,841
Quick, fast, swift!

481
00:19:18,175 --> 00:19:19,925
Mr. Inspector!

482
00:19:19,925 --> 00:19:22,175
We know the law too!

483
00:19:22,175 --> 00:19:25,175
I'm asking you, the representative of the law!

484
00:19:25,550 --> 00:19:26,841
What's wrong with

485
00:19:26,925 --> 00:19:28,425
My brother,

486
00:19:28,466 --> 00:19:29,800
On my guarantee,

487
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:31,216
Or Sir's,

488
00:19:31,300 --> 00:19:32,841
Or even the lady's,

489
00:19:32,925 --> 00:19:34,550
Sleeping at his own house tonight?

490
00:19:34,591 --> 00:19:37,841
Your guarantee, Sir's and so on don't matter to me!

491
00:19:38,091 --> 00:19:39,675
The lady is his guarantor!

492
00:19:39,800 --> 00:19:41,716
If she consents, I have no objection!

493
00:19:43,716 --> 00:19:44,675
Lady, do you consent?

494
00:19:44,675 --> 00:19:45,216
Not me!

495
00:19:46,341 --> 00:19:47,341
How do I know

496
00:19:47,425 --> 00:19:49,966
That just as they helped poor wretched Dustali escape,

497
00:19:49,966 --> 00:19:51,216
They won't help Asdollah escape too!

498
00:19:51,966 --> 00:19:53,800
Then where would I go looking for him?

499
00:19:56,216 --> 00:19:58,175
I can only be responsible

500
00:19:58,341 --> 00:20:00,175
If Asdollah is under my own eyes!

501
00:20:06,175 --> 00:20:07,466
Asdollah!

502
00:20:07,466 --> 00:20:08,966
Why have you gone mute!

503
00:20:09,300 --> 00:20:10,841
Say something yourself!

504
00:20:11,050 --> 00:20:12,716
Why don't you speak up?

505
00:20:13,300 --> 00:20:15,300
Brother, against the force of the law,

506
00:20:15,300 --> 00:20:16,550
What can I say?

507
00:20:18,300 --> 00:20:20,550
This is truly disgraceful!

508
00:20:28,925 --> 00:20:30,300
To get a receipt, I'll

509
00:20:30,341 --> 00:20:31,800
Come with you to the house myself.

510
00:20:32,675 --> 00:20:33,841
Aspiran Ghias Abadi!

511
00:20:34,175 --> 00:20:34,966
Yes, Sir!

512
00:20:35,300 --> 00:20:37,300
Move out, with the lady and the killer!

513
00:20:37,466 --> 00:20:38,675
Get up, dear!

514
00:20:38,675 --> 00:20:40,175
Get up, Asdollah dear!

515
00:20:41,841 --> 00:20:42,800
Don’t be afraid!

516
00:20:42,841 --> 00:20:43,841
Come, let’s go.

517
00:20:46,050 --> 00:20:47,300
Asdollah!

518
00:20:47,341 --> 00:20:48,675
Shame on you!

519
00:20:48,716 --> 00:20:49,300
Moment!

520
00:20:49,675 --> 00:20:50,716
Moment!

521
00:20:51,050 --> 00:20:52,425
Strange business, huh!

522
00:20:52,800 --> 00:20:54,675
Two days ago I came just to say hello and go,

523
00:20:54,675 --> 00:20:56,050
And somehow I became a killer!

524
00:20:56,091 --> 00:20:57,341
I spent two days in prison!

525
00:20:57,341 --> 00:20:58,466
I dug up my garden!

526
00:20:58,550 --> 00:20:59,841
And now I have to hear insults!

527
00:21:01,591 --> 00:21:04,300
If, God forbid, something happens…

528
00:21:04,425 --> 00:21:06,800
You're responsible, for making me a killer!

529
00:21:06,841 --> 00:21:07,425
Quiet!

530
00:21:08,050 --> 00:21:09,216
Aspiran Ghias Abadi!

531
00:21:09,425 --> 00:21:10,175
Yes, Sir!

532
00:21:10,425 --> 00:21:11,966
Statue of stupidity!

533
00:21:12,425 --> 00:21:13,300
Yes, Sir!

534
00:21:13,300 --> 00:21:14,300
Quick, fast, swift!

535
00:21:14,341 --> 00:21:16,050
Toward San Francisco!

536
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:17,050
Come in, Lady Aziz.

537
00:21:20,925 --> 00:21:21,800
Good night, gentlemen.

538
00:21:39,050 --> 00:21:41,841
You act as if you aren't the head of this family!

539
00:21:42,050 --> 00:21:43,300
How long will this scandal go on?

540
00:21:43,300 --> 00:21:44,425
How long this stubbornness?

541
00:21:44,550 --> 00:21:45,675
That's all we needed,

542
00:21:45,716 --> 00:21:46,091
For

543
00:21:46,091 --> 00:21:48,675
The police and the courts to set foot in this house!

544
00:21:48,675 --> 00:21:49,675
Quiet!

545
00:21:49,800 --> 00:21:52,466
You're stabbing me in the back too!

546
00:21:53,175 --> 00:21:54,925
I'm at the end of my rope!

547
00:21:55,175 --> 00:21:56,675
On one side, that man!

548
00:21:56,716 --> 00:21:57,800
That vile man!

549
00:21:57,841 --> 00:21:59,300
And on the other, you!

550
00:21:59,466 --> 00:22:01,425
What on earth am I to do?

551
00:22:02,050 --> 00:22:03,550
I talked to him!

552
00:22:04,175 --> 00:22:06,800
If you two don't make up by tomorrow morning,

553
00:22:06,925 --> 00:22:10,050
If this nonsense doesn't end by tomorrow morning,

554
00:22:10,300 --> 00:22:11,841
Like my other brothers, I too

555
00:22:11,841 --> 00:22:13,175
Will leave this house!

556
00:22:13,175 --> 00:22:15,175
And go live somewhere else!

557
00:22:15,216 --> 00:22:17,175
Why are you so gullible!

558
00:22:17,300 --> 00:22:18,550
I'll rent the house out

559
00:22:18,550 --> 00:22:20,466
To some neighborhood thugs and riffraff!

560
00:22:20,550 --> 00:22:21,925
Now that he's backed down,

561
00:22:21,966 --> 00:22:23,800
You should let it go too!

562
00:22:24,425 --> 00:22:26,466
Why are you so gullible?

563
00:22:26,675 --> 00:22:29,175
Don't you know this man?

564
00:22:29,425 --> 00:22:30,966
He's a snake!

565
